<div type="level1" xml:id="wibarab.paratexts.meeting-with-laurent-romary">
  <head>Meeting with Laurent Romary</head>
  <p><hi rendition="simple:bold">20th May 2022</hi>: The Director of
  Scientific Culture and Information and TEI expert Laurent Romary is
  invited to Vienna to meet up with the WIBARAB members involved in the
  creation of the database, namely all the members of the ACDH-CH,
  the PI Stephan Prochazka and post-doc Ana Iriarte Diez accompanied by
  the master students. He advises the team on how to proceed with the
  buildup of the database using TEI and how to overcome conceptual and
  technical obstacles.  </p>
</div>

